{"id":"int-197c66e1","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-18T15:19:01.547419198Z","actor":"Sean McConnachie","issue_id":"beads-auto-imp-xdv","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"gitguard now generates a pre-commit that runs beads' hook and then unstages .beads/issues.jsonl and .beads/interactions.jsonl from the worker's index, and the integrator resolves a conflict in either to the copy the base already had rather than spending a model call on it. Correction to the issue's premise, verified twice here: beads' pre-commit exports into the MAIN checkout, not the worktree, because bd resolves .beads by walking up and worktree.Root puts every worktree under <repo>/.beads/auto/wt. So no worker commit in this repo currently carries the export, and the unstage is a guard against the worktree root moving rather than a repair of an observed conflict; the integrator half is what covers a conflict that arrives anyway."}}
