{"id":"int-4e36716b","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-18T21:53:48.0799834Z","actor":"Sean McConnachie","issue_id":"beads-auto-imp-bq1","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"internal/similar scores two texts on the rarity-weighted terms they share. Measured by sweeping all 4371 pairs of this repo's real backlog: 6up/pzi, the duplicate that cost a drain attempt, stands alone at 0.63 and is dropped outright; 1p8/b6m sits at 0.32 in a band it shares with epics and their own children, so it is reported to a human rather than resolved. Two thresholds rather than one tuned number, because tuning until that pair passed would fit this backlog and lose real work in the next. Tests found two bugs on the way in: camelCase split after lowercasing, and map-order float summation making scores differ between runs."}}
{"id":"int-0eaf2803","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-08-18T21:53:49.027327749Z","actor":"Sean McConnachie","issue_id":"beads-auto-imp-ej3","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"discovered_work: triage is the default and the barrier files nothing. Staging is .beads/auto/triage.json, which outlives the run; bd-auto triage --list/--accept/--into/--discard/--accept-all is the human's half, scriptable so a smoke test can drive it. Fold-into-existing is the shape that was missing. defer and immediate are unchanged and now also consult internal/similar. This repo switched itself to triage."}}
